# Intent: Removes the Reaction Time game completely (owner request 2026-11-17: Do It takes its place with the Reaction Time interface). The pack is no longer embedded, the player's table has seven games (memory, whack, tictactoe, bopit, rps, eightball, dice), and the start tool and its sentences no longer name it. A saved reaction score stays in the unit's flash under its old key and is never read again (it is dropped quietly). The pages and the More screen read the table, so the game is gone from the Games page and the More list.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_games.cc (ours, G01, UI13, UI15, LK03, GM02)
# Check after a flash: self.game.list names seven games and no reaction game; self.game.start with the name reaction answers that the game is not on this unit.
# Kconfig: none

